   00171|     // reference and stopping is what issue #904 reported: nothing the request
   00172|     // asked for was ever produced. The issue itself is where the artifact is
   00173|     // named, so read it before concluding that nothing can be executed — the
   00174|     // capability is only genuinely unavailable once the fetch has been tried.
   00175|     if plan.mode == GeneralPlanMode::RepositoryWorkItem {
